@coalition
title: Negotiating with the coalition
subtitle: Calm our partners down.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if spd_in_government = 0 : We are not in government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government = 1
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0; cdu_relation += 4; greens_relation += 4; fdp_relation += 4

Long evenings in the coalition committee pay off. Our partners are calmer.

@lander
title: The SPD in the Länder
subtitle: Use our Länder governments.
